              "left": 60,
              "top": 150,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 88,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Explain how companies raise capital through shares, prospectuses, banks, venture capital, and other financing sources while managing creditor claims.</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#334155",
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "text_lan110_module_03_outcomes",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 265,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 160,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>Learning outcomes</strong></p><p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">• Compare equity finance and debt finance</p><p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">• Explain the role of shares, prospectuses, banks, and venture capital</p><p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">• Use accurate language for investor and creditor claims</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#1f2937",
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "text_lan110_module_03_assessment",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 455,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 55,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: center;\">Assessment focus: explain the concept, apply it to a business example, and use accurate finance vocabulary.</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#4c1d95",
              "rotate": 0
            }
          ],
